**错误示例**：
```typescript
// ❌ 不要这样做
interface ConfigWriter {
  write(provider: Provider): void
}

class CodexWriter implements ConfigWriter { ... }
class ClaudeWriter implements ConfigWriter { ... }
```

**正确做法**：
```typescript
